# apps/web Rules

## Stack
Next.js 16, React 19, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui, Framer Motion, TanStack Query, i18next.

## Client vs Server components
- Add `"use client"` for interactive components (hooks, event handlers, animations)
- Layout and page-level wrappers are server components by default

## i18n
```tsx
"use client"
import { useTranslation } from "@repo/i18n"

const { t } = useTranslation()
// t("myKey") — key must exist in both ptBR and enUS locales
```

## Colors — only semantic Tailwind classes
```
bg-background    text-foreground
bg-card          text-card-foreground
bg-muted         text-muted-foreground
bg-primary       text-primary-foreground
border-border    ring-ring
```
Never raw oklch, hex, or rgb in components.

## Typography
- `font-sans` → Geist (body)
- `font-serif` → Merriweather (decorative, dates)
- `font-mono` → JetBrains Mono

## Theme
Both light and dark themes have equal visual weight. Verify changes in both.
Dark mode via `.dark` class (`@custom-variant dark (&:is(.dark *))`).

## Component location
- Feature component → `components/[featureName]/index.tsx`
- Sub-component → `components/[featureName]/my-sub.tsx`
- UI primitive → `components/ui/` (check here before creating)

## Page sections (in order)
`#hero` → `#about` → `#projects` → `#experience` → `#contact` → QuoteSection

Max width: `max-w-3xl mx-auto`, padding: `px-6 lg:px-0`

## Adding content
- New project → `constants/projects.ts` + i18n keys + image in `public/projects/`
- New experience → `constants/experience.ts` + i18n keys + logo in `public/icons/companies/`
- New skill → `constants/skills.ts` + SVG in `public/icons/skills/`
